 "caveats": [
  "Most of the fortnight's change is how much our base station listens to, not how the network behaves; week against week is not like for like.",
  "One base station hears all of this; stations it cannot hear are not counted, missing or not.",
  "Kunghur and Dunbible Creek's battery readings of 9.5 to 10 V while still transmitting look more like a scale on file than flat batteries.",
  "Bit flips before 21 October have no carrier, so who sent them is shared out by pass range only."
